# Accepted findings, with reasons. All are LOW/MEDIUM; CI only fails on
# fixable HIGH/CRITICAL, but these are recorded here so they show as
# explicitly accepted rather than silently absent.

# S3 bucket logging is disabled on the Terraform state bucket. Needs a
# separate log-target bucket; out of scope for this exercise. See README
# Shortcuts.
AVD-AWS-0089

# ECR repository uses the default AES256 encryption, not a customer-managed
# KMS key. The module supports a CMK via kms_key_arn; AES256 is an
# intentional default for this exercise.
AVD-AWS-0033

# The base Dockerfile has no HEALTHCHECK. Kubernetes liveness/readiness
# probes (startupProbe, livenessProbe on /healthz, readinessProbe on
# /readyz) are the real health check in this deployment model.
AVD-DS-0026

# k8s/base is a Kustomize base, not deployed directly. The overlays set the
# real image tag (CI writes the git SHA) and namespace (items-api); flagging
# the base in isolation is a false positive.
AVD-KSV-0013
AVD-KSV-0110

# The ConfigMap key is "PORT", a port number, not a secret. False positive
# on the key name alone.
AVD-KSV-01010
